  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13E;om mikrograntu je zak&#xFA;pi&#x165; vybavenie do vn&#xFA;torn&#xFD;ch priestorov tzv. biznis inkub&#xE1;tora pre za&#x10D;&#xED;naj&#xFA;ce firmy (n&#xE1;bytok, bezpe&#x10D;nostn&#xE9; kamery).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to purchase equipment for the internal premises of the so-called business incubator for start-up companies (furniture, security cameras).</narrative>
  </description>
